<title>UK: BIL sets 2.0 billion Luxfr bond due Dec 2002.</title>
<headline>BIL sets 2.0 billion Luxfr bond due Dec 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BIL and CCB:</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE INTERNATIONAL A LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FLUX  COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    23.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.25    PAY DATE   L23.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA-   DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  LUX	 YIELD	 4.51 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON. ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
